{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家統計局數據顯示，內地首10個月房地產開發投資按年跌21.6%，再創歷來最大跌幅，跌幅比首9個月擴大1個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\n首10個月新建商品房銷售面積及銷售額，按年分別跌13.7%及14.3%，兩者跌幅分別擴大0.5及0.4個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\n統計局指出，房地產開發企業到位資金按年跌幅擴大至21.9%，新開工面積跌幅收窄至24.4%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.515319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:25:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T00:18:54.484189+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:44:34.956160+00:00","content_hash":"04aeee959b9cecd7d93bcf60037360ca7248585539d4191024605f0c66488feb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}